    "rating": 4.6,
    "reference": "ChIJvV7--0U2yUwRu92ENje360E",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Mark Donald Cuizon",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110018039057076319119/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLf9RNMl-DfiSEF1y23mTUH63dv5jcCkrMaPghJN1TLqBVcyg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I bought a tree here and the product itself was great. However, when I asked for a copy of my receipt—something I needed urgently for compensation with the city—the staff told me it was “impossible,” even though I had the exact credit card and date of purchase. There was no effort to help or even check the system. The lack of customer service was disappointing, and it turned an otherwise good experience into a frustrating one. Hoping the store can improve their support in situations like this.",
        "time": 1764298717,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dawnna David",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108768975794179929704/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW2ax2XJ5bLBKOr89EEmnq0ODPTbEjuH0FVAnsEmtz_u-jc4453=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "On my last trip to the nursery, I was very pleased with the service we received. Loup spent the time to explain about  the different plants we bought. He did it timely and politely. Alex was very helpful as he offered to prepared our plants for the car before he cashed us out. I most certainly will return and recommend to others. The reasons are: staff is knowledgeable of the products and professional and friendly.",
        "time": 1754743871,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Judy Hung",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108337021180260241258/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXlkhFi0xIrlxozKypsBluMXtnhPJ1bw9nrUa90vWN2n-9yBjKJgw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Super friendly and helpful staffs; got most of our gardening plants and stuffs here; many interesting stuffs we got here including tropical lime trees, as well as haskap berry trees. Things are nicely organized. Many selections of roses as well! Love their friendly cute store cat !",
        "time": 1687741238,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sana Javadi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100378472001252893379/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKo0_CNCWZYJRrtEvWPQgtWmrv0O1ydzvO-hKQ_z015WA30WMg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Unfortunately I need to edit my review! I keep the original one for them to know how the wrong behavior affects the business!\nAt the beginning of the season we purchased plants and trees worth almost 400$!\nWe were happy as on the bill it was mentioned there is guarantee.....\nFirst challenge their delivery system that they don't know when they may come and they CAN NOT give you a call ahead of time maybe 30 min , then I lost half a day of work! Then the raspberry died and we requested the exchange, the response was SOOOOO rude, and refused to keep the promise of guarantee as mentioned on the bill, we did not have the tag and nowhere was mentioned we need to provide the tag for exchange, and they said you must take the plant out and bring it with the tag and bill!!!!! And very rude! Imagine you buy a tree for couples of hundreds of dollars and they don't respect the guarantee unless you bring it back with allllll documents! Well! We finally could get our money back after 2 weeks of fighting and complain, but I never go back and never recommend this place and this is not all issues we had! Another plant died also however we followed all the instructions and care and that money got wasted totally as they said that plant is not guaranteed! .... Very disappointed!!!!!\nThis was my original review 👇👇👇\nI LOVE the place, as a gardening lover, this is my place for this year because I just moved to the area. Can't wait for new arrivals.",
        "time": 1750822847,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "lina cantali",
